<subpara id="RM000004B1J000X_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IB800000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>When the engine control computer is replaced with a new one, be sure to perform initialization. (For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002ADC004X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000004B1J000X_07" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
