<testgrp id="RM000004B1J000X_07_0023" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IKY00000">
<testtitle>Check DTC (Cruise Control System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Put the vehicle in the conditions under which the DTC is detected.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The system cannot detect the malfunction unless the detection conditions are met.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test2>
<ptxt>Drive within the cruise control set vehicle speed range.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the main switch of the cruise control main switch ON.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Push the -SET switch to activate cruise control (vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode).</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Depress the brake pedal to cancel cruise control.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, display [Diagnosis] - [Powertrain] - [TCCS] - [DTC Freeze Data] and check the DTCs.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.89in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>P0571 is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
